{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"retries","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The maximum number of times to retry the upstream, defaulting to 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"error","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The specific error type that should trigger a retry if a cast succeeds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that emits the same output as the upstream but retries on the specified error up to the specified number of times.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method returns an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that retries the upstream only when an error can be cast to the specified error type, up to the given number of retries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all "},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s can be retried. For example, "},{"code":"AsyncStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"AsyncThrowingStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot be retried on their own."}]},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["actor CallCounter {","    private(set) var count = 0","    func increment() -> Int {","        count += 1","        return count","    }","}","","enum NetworkError: Error {","    case timeout","    case unknown","}","","let counter = CallCounter()","","let sequence = DeferredTas